        "notes": "Round 2: Continued Credit Farming and Item Purchases\n\nContinue the same credit-farming strategy as Round 1, focusing on positioning near the enemy tank to trigger Overheat and ignite them for maximum credit gains and burn damage. Use Fortify strategically to avoid taking heavy damage when advancing. In Round 2, prioritize purchasing the following blue items to enhance your AOE capabilities, and acquire optional items if your credit reserves allow.\n\nRound 2 Required Purchases:\n\n [Electro Lights](item_d4ac5963-81ea-41b8-bc26-71905fadf860) (Ability): Adds an electrified effect to abilities, increasing damage and synergizing with burn effects to amplify backline disruption.\n\n [Solar Regenergy](item_b03b2c68-d3e3-413a-a9b8-3385149ba9b8) (Ability): Enhances ability energy regeneration, enabling more frequent use of Javelin Spin and Overheat to sustain AOE burn output.\n\nRound 2 Optional Purchases (if affordable):\n\n[Siphonic Spear](item_82c46448-08f2-4664-842c-c04d3120369a)  (Weapon): Enhances Javelin Spin and melee attacks with a lifesteal effect, restoring health per hit to bolster sustainability during aggressive backline engagements.\n\n[Charged Chassis](item_b2307dff-5e70-4c77-bae2-2b0c2883c5bb)  (Survivability): Grants a temporary movement speed boost when using abilities, improving your ability to dance through the enemy backline and retreat safely.\n\n[Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318)  (Ability): Boosts ability power by +10%, further amplifying Javelin Spin\u2019s AOE burn damage if not purchased in Round 1 or if stackable.\n\n[Field Rations](item_46ae6709-1166-426f-bca3-97a538d3f089)  (Survivability): Provides passive health regeneration over time, enhancing sustainability during prolonged backline skirmishes.\n\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)  (Weapon): Enhances weapon stability, increasing primary attack reliability if not purchased in Round 1 or if stackable.",
